WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.087 --> 00:00:02.341
- I'm here at Einstein Bagels,

00:00:02.341 --> 00:00:04.639
picking up the caffeinated bagels

00:00:04.639 --> 00:00:06.088
that everybody is talking about.

00:00:06.088 --> 00:00:08.588
(happy music)

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.026
- I call it double buzz.

00:00:13.026 --> 00:00:16.904
They can have a coffee, and a
bagel with the caffeine in it.

00:00:16.904 --> 00:00:18.319
- 32 milligrams of caffeine,

00:00:18.319 --> 00:00:21.892
I read online that it's about
a third of a cup of coffee.

00:00:21.892 --> 00:00:22.725
- Yes.

00:00:22.725 --> 00:00:23.558
- That sound about right?

00:00:23.558 --> 00:00:24.543
- Yes, that's about right.

00:00:24.543 --> 00:00:27.248
- Fuck yeah, I drink
coffee every day for sure.

00:00:27.248 --> 00:00:28.768
- You haven't drank coffee today though.

00:00:28.768 --> 00:00:29.601
- No.

00:00:29.601 --> 00:00:31.411
- Doesn't seem like it.

00:00:31.411 --> 00:00:32.480
- I've already had two cups this morning.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:33.522
- (laughs) Really?
- So I'm gonna be like,

00:00:33.522 --> 00:00:34.355
Yeah!
- Yeah.

00:00:34.355 --> 00:00:36.586
- I'm like imagining like,
those like, hipsters,

00:00:36.586 --> 00:00:38.336
who like, drink coffee, and like,

00:00:38.336 --> 00:00:40.783
eat this bagel at the same time.

00:00:40.783 --> 00:00:42.376
- I'm actually excited
'cause I love bagels.

00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:44.420
- Oh, I love bagels, I love coffee.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:45.899
- You are slow right now.

00:00:45.899 --> 00:00:46.732
(laughs)

00:00:46.732 --> 00:00:48.948
- [Interviewer] You look very sleepy,

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:52.495
you sound very sleepy, you need caffeine.

00:00:52.495 --> 00:00:54.123
- Please, give me caffeine.

00:00:54.123 --> 00:00:55.403
(laughs)

00:00:55.403 --> 00:00:57.681
(intense music)

00:00:57.681 --> 00:00:59.178
- Mmm.
- Ooh, it looks good!

00:00:59.178 --> 00:01:00.261
- Yeah it does!

00:01:00.261 --> 00:01:01.970
- They smell chocolatey, smell it.

00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:03.844
- Oh, they do smell chocolatey, wow!

00:01:03.844 --> 00:01:05.673
- So we're gonna try
it plain and untoasted,

00:01:05.673 --> 00:01:07.668
and then toasted with cream cheese.

00:01:07.668 --> 00:01:08.918
- Yes.
- Cheers.

00:01:11.014 --> 00:01:12.418
- I feel like the coffee's subtle.

00:01:12.418 --> 00:01:13.742
- When I breathe out,

00:01:13.742 --> 00:01:16.176
I get a little bit of that
bitterness in my sinuses.

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:17.765
- I'm bad at tasting things,

00:01:17.765 --> 00:01:19.874
like I don't have a really
good sense of taste.

00:01:19.874 --> 00:01:21.717
- Literally what our
job is here at Buzzfeed.

00:01:21.717 --> 00:01:22.557
Tasting.
- Yeah.

00:01:22.557 --> 00:01:25.475
- The aftertaste does taste
like an espresso or something.

00:01:25.475 --> 00:01:26.308
- Yeah.

00:01:26.308 --> 00:01:27.725
- It definitely tastes fresh.

00:01:27.725 --> 00:01:29.217
- Oh, it's very good.

00:01:29.217 --> 00:01:30.228
It's a solid bagel.

00:01:30.228 --> 00:01:32.482
- Good, but a little too bitter.

00:01:32.482 --> 00:01:33.353
I feel like if,

00:01:33.353 --> 00:01:34.331
I think the cream cheese would help.

00:01:34.331 --> 00:01:35.164
- Yeah.
- For sure.

00:01:35.164 --> 00:01:36.767
(bang)

00:01:36.767 --> 00:01:38.120
- I think this is gonna
taste good because,

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:40.191
you say, it's like you
can taste the bitterness,

00:01:40.191 --> 00:01:41.412
sort of, of the espresso.

00:01:41.412 --> 00:01:42.366
So then, like cream cheese,

00:01:42.366 --> 00:01:44.355
which would give all that sweet
flavor to it, would be nice.

00:01:44.355 --> 00:01:46.688
(crunching)

00:01:47.646 --> 00:01:49.624
- Mmm, I like it with the cream cheese.

00:01:49.624 --> 00:01:50.457
- Mmmhmm.

00:01:50.457 --> 00:01:51.344
- Mmm, delicious.

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:52.898
- You can't go wrong with
cream cheese, really.

00:01:52.898 --> 00:01:53.994
- (laughs) that's true!

00:01:53.994 --> 00:01:56.387
- Oh yeah, that's really good.

00:01:56.387 --> 00:01:58.703
- I actually would really like
this with a cup of coffee.

00:01:58.703 --> 00:02:01.813
I feel like that would be like
the perfect compliment to it.

00:02:01.813 --> 00:02:05.683
- I feel like I feel more awake,
but I know that's placebo.

00:02:05.683 --> 00:02:06.917
- I actually do love this.

00:02:06.917 --> 00:02:08.260
- I do, I really do love it.

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:10.518
- Yeah, it's a good
bagel, especially for LA.

00:02:10.518 --> 00:02:11.679
- Mmmhmm.

00:02:11.679 --> 00:02:14.440
- Usually LA bagels are garbage
so, this is pretty good.

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:16.693
But not enough caffeine, for my taste.

00:02:16.693 --> 00:02:20.273
- I don't think it's gonna
effect me like that much.

00:02:20.273 --> 00:02:21.829
I feel like this is more of like,

00:02:21.829 --> 00:02:24.248
a thing that I will eat with my coffee.

00:02:24.248 --> 00:02:25.253
- For me it's not useful

00:02:25.253 --> 00:02:27.356
to have a third of a cup
of coffee in a bagel,

00:02:27.356 --> 00:02:29.031
so yeah, I'd probably
want it to be stronger.

00:02:29.031 --> 00:02:31.456
(mischievous music)

00:02:31.456 --> 00:02:34.155
- So, it's been about an hour
since I had the coffee bagel,

00:02:34.155 --> 00:02:35.629
and I feel like, pretty awake.

00:02:35.629 --> 00:02:37.180
'Bout like a half a cup of coffee.

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:38.921
So, it works.

00:02:38.921 --> 00:02:39.754
- It's been about three hours

00:02:39.754 --> 00:02:42.266
since we had the Espresso Buzz bagel,

00:02:42.266 --> 00:02:43.438
or whatever the hell it's called.

00:02:43.438 --> 00:02:46.058
And, ya know, I have some energy still.

00:02:46.058 --> 00:02:48.032
Ya know, I feel like it's
just been sustaining me

00:02:48.032 --> 00:02:48.976
throughout the whole day.

00:02:48.976 --> 00:02:51.559
- I never really felt anything,

00:02:53.443 --> 00:02:54.630
other than full.

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:57.809
- Would eat it again,
but, need more coffee.

00:02:57.809 --> 00:03:00.346
- To be honest, they
taste pretty good to me,

00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:03.628
but I don't feel energized
from eating them.

00:03:03.628 --> 00:03:07.822
I feel like I do still need
to get my coffee intake.

00:03:07.822 --> 00:03:09.472
- I haven't had any coffee today

00:03:09.472 --> 00:03:11.205
other than basically the bagel,

00:03:11.205 --> 00:03:12.447
and I'm not tired.

00:03:12.447 --> 00:03:13.298
Usually at this time

00:03:13.298 --> 00:03:16.387
I need a cup of coffee to
wake up and actually work,

00:03:16.387 --> 00:03:18.019
but right now, I'm not tired at all.

00:03:18.019 --> 00:03:19.323
- One thing I have noticed though,

00:03:19.323 --> 00:03:22.222
is that it's been making
me poop a little bit more.

00:03:22.222 --> 00:03:24.011
Which I know coffee does to me sometimes.

00:03:24.011 --> 00:03:26.695
So yeah, I've been poopin'
more too because of it.

00:03:26.695 --> 00:03:27.770
Good job bagel!

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:29.803
- [Garrett] Are there any other
liquids you can see making,

00:03:29.803 --> 00:03:31.348
being turned into a bagel?

00:03:31.348 --> 00:03:32.476
- [Jordan] Oh, Kool-Aid, for sure.

00:03:32.476 --> 00:03:34.976
- A Kool-Aid bagel, get on it!

